    "finding": "budget_pressure cannot fire because the compaction trigger decision is made inside ContextCompactor.compact() from the source iteration count and candidate count, while token-budget resolution belongs to Context Engineering's selection stage, which runs AFTER candidate construction. The compactor is never handed a resolved budget, so no code path lets budget pressure influence the compaction decision.",
