    "classification_rationale": "An iteration-count trigger fires deterministically and long before the budget could be exhausted, so context growth stays bounded. Budget-pressure compaction is therefore an OPTIMIZATION for the narrow band of few-but-very-large iterations, not a correctness requirement. Budget ownership was NOT moved and no double budgeting was introduced."
